1
00:00:00,506 --> 00:00:03,096
(Leonard:)I'm pretty sure I never said that.

2
00:00:03,676 --> 00:00:06,766
(Penny:)No, you did better than that.
You helped me see it on my own.

3
00:00:06,929 --> 00:00:08,309
Oh, good for me.

4
00:00:10,349 --> 00:00:12,639
(Leonard:)- Where are you going?
- I'm going over to Mike's.

5
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:15,600
(Penny:)- Leonard, thank you so much.
- Oh, sure.

6
00:00:21,026 --> 00:00:22,196
(Leonard:)Huh.

7
00:00:22,361 --> 00:00:24,701
(Leonard:)Maybe I am her gay friend.

8
00:00:31,245 --> 00:00:33,535
(Sheldon:)Howard, I'm going
to need another Mandarin lesson.

9
00:00:33,706 --> 00:00:37,126
(Sheldon:)I obviously didn't make my point
with those people.

10
00:00:37,751 --> 00:00:40,211
(Howard:)For God's sake,
if you don't like tangerine chicken...

11
00:00:40,379 --> 00:00:41,919
...don't order tangerine chicken.

12
00:00:42,089 --> 00:00:45,299
(Sheldon:)I like tangerine chicken.
I'm just not getting tangerine chicken.

13
00:00:47,136 --> 00:00:49,476
- Can we please change the subject?
- Sure.

14
00:00:49,889 --> 00:00:53,889
(Raj:)Tell us again how you screwed up and got
Penny back together with her old boyfriend.

15
00:00:54,935 --> 00:01:00,025
(Leonard:)Just roll the dice.

